  "truthBoundary": "A55 validates one externally signed, hash-bound review bundle covering security, data/provider rights, payments, operations and legal/customer communication, plus a dual-control canary-preparation attestation. It verifies cryptographic signatures against an externally anchored trust-root file and enforces reviewer independence and zero open Critical/High findings. It does not prove the competence, honesty or legal authority of a signer beyond the supplied trust roots; it does not execute the retests, enable sale, prove LIVE, approve production or replace legal advice.",
